      "text": [
        "<strong dir=\"rtl\">אַבָּא I</strong>, <strong dir=\"rtl\">אָב</strong>  ch. = h. <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Jastrow,_אָב II.1\" data-ref=\"Jastrow, אָב II 1\"><span dir=\"rtl\">אָב</span> II</a>  . <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Onkelos_Genesis.17.4\" data-ref=\"Onkelos Genesis 17:4\">Targ. Gen. XVII, 4</a>. <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Onkelos_Genesis.41.43\" data-ref=\"Onkelos Genesis 41:43\">Targ. O. ib. XLI, 43</a>; a. fr.—Freq. <a dir=\"rtl\" class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Jastrow,_אַבָּא I.1\" data-ref=\"Jastrow, אַבָּא I 1\">אַבָּא</a> (also in Hebr. phraseol.) <i>my father</i>. <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Mishnah_Sanhedrin.3.2\" data-ref=\"Mishnah Sanhedrin 3:2\">Snh. III, 2</a>. <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Mishnah_Bava_Batra.9.3\" data-ref=\"Mishnah Bava Batra 9:3\">B. Bath. IX, 3</a>; a. fr. <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Megillah.12b.6\" data-ref=\"Megillah 12b:6\">Meg. 12ᵇ</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">אהורייריה דא׳</span> my father’s steward. <span dir=\"rtl\">אבי א׳</span> <i>my grandfather</i>. <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Berakhot.10a.31\" data-ref=\"Berakhot 10a:31\">Ber. 10ᵃ</a> bot.—<a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Sanhedrin.113a.16\" data-ref=\"Sanhedrin 113a:16\">Snh. 113ᵃ</a> bot. <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ אליהו</span> father Elijah (sarcastically).—<span dir=\"rtl\">אָבוֹהֵ ד־</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אָבוֹי ד־</span> N.’s father. <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Berakhot.18b.14\" data-ref=\"Berakhot 18b:14\">Ber. 18ᵇ</a>; <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"Jerusalem_Talmud_Bava_Metzia.4.1.3\" data-ref=\"Jerusalem Talmud Bava Metzia 4:1:3\">Y. B. Mets. IV, 9ᶜ</a> top; a. fr.—<span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ סב</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ רבה</span> <i>grandfather</i>. Targ. II, <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Esther.7.10\" data-ref=\"Esther 7:10\">Esth. VII, 10</a>. <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Yevamot.21b.7\" data-ref=\"Yevamot 21b:7\">Yeb. 21ᵇ</a>.—Trnsf. <i>origin, source</i>. <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Shabbat.22a.4\" data-ref=\"Shabbat 22a:4\">Sabb. 22ᵃ</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲבוּהוֹן דכולהון דם</span> the source of all analogous cases is the law about blood (that you must cover it from a sense of propriety).—Pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲבָהָן</span>, <a dir=\"rtl\" class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Jastrow,_אֲבָהָתָא.1\" data-ref=\"Jastrow, אֲבָהָתָא 1\">אֲבָהָתָא</a> <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Targum_Jonathan_on_Deuteronomy.24.16\" data-ref=\"Targum Jonathan on Deuteronomy 24:16\">Targ. Y. Deut. XXIV, 16</a>. <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Targum_of_I_Chronicles.1.2\" data-ref=\"Targum of I Chronicles 1:2\">Targ. I Chr. I, 2</a>; a. fr. <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Menachot.53a.14\" data-ref=\"Menachot 53a:14\">Men. 53ᵃ</a> <a dir=\"rtl\" class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Jastrow,_אמוראי.1\" data-ref=\"Jastrow, אמוראי 1\">בר א׳</a> of distinguished birth.—Kidd. 83ᵃ; a. fr.—[אֲבָהֵי <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Aramaic_Targum_to_Proverbs.19.14\" data-ref=\"Aramaic Targum to Proverbs 19:14\">Targ. Prov. XIX, 14</a> Ms.; read with ed. Wil. <span dir=\"rtl\">אבהן</span>; oth. ed. <a dir=\"rtl\" class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Jastrow,_אַבָּהוּ.1\" data-ref=\"Jastrow, אַבָּהוּ 1\">אבהו</a> corr. acc.]"
      ]
    }
